<title>UK: Reuters sees GLOBEX closing after 1998.</title>
<headline>Reuters sees GLOBEX closing after 1998.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Reuters Holdings Plc said on Tuesday that GLOBEX, the automated matching system for futures contracts built with the Chicago Mercantile Exchange and the MATIF futures exchange in France, was not likely to continue beyond 1998 as the original partners develop their own systems.</p>
<p>&quot;This product has never been particularly successful and its closure will not produce any material impact on the company's results,&quot; Reuters said in its 1996 results statement.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
